aim is strongly implausible or conflicts with remembered facts, set conflict=uncertain and never invent a textual counter source. Keep role fit separate: direct relation claims can be factually false. Do not reject unfamiliar but explicitly supported namesakes just because memory knows only a famous one. A claimed convention secretly being a space agency deserves scrutiny. Do not label same-role competing dates wrong_argument.\nInput: {\"question\": \"1978 college football season was part of which division?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 238, \"text\": \"1978 NCAA Division I-A football season The 1978 NCAA Division I-A football season was the first season of Division I-A football; Division I-A was created in 1978 when Division I was subdivided into Division I-A and I-AA for football only.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d00\", \"start\": 239, \"end\": 276, \"text\": \"The season came down to a rare #1 vs.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d00\", \"start\": 277, \"end\": 369, \"text\": \"#2 post-season meeting as #1 Penn State and #2 Alabama met in the New Year's Day Sugar Bowl.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d00\", \"start\": 370, \"end\": 463, \"text\": \"The game is most remembered for Alabama's goal line stand with four minutes left in the game.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d00\", \"start\": 464, \"end\": 540, \"text\": \"On fourth down and a foot, Alabama managed to keep Penn State out of the end\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 29, \"text\": \"On 9 November 2023, at 10:01.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d01\", \"start\": 30, \"end\": 292, \"text\": \"All structured data from the main, Property, Lexeme, and EntitySchema namespaces is available under the Creative Commons CC0 License; text in the other namespaces is available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike License; additional terms may apply.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d01\", \"start\": 293, \"end\": 362, \"text\": \"By using this site, you agree to the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d01\", \"start\": 363, \"end\": 557, \"text\": \"Privacy policy About Wikidata Disclaimers Code of Conduct Developers Statistics Cookie statement Mobile view Data access Search Search 1978 NCAA Division III football season (Q4578219) Add topic\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 368, \"text\": \"1978 NCAA Division III football season The 1978 NCAA Division III football season, part of college football in the United States organized by the National Collegiate Athletic Association at the Division III level, began in August 1978, and concluded with the NCAA Division III Football Championship in December 1978 at Garrett-Harrison Stadium in Phenix City, Alabama.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d02\", \"start\": 369, \"end\": 505, \"text\": \"The Baldwin Wallace Yellow Jackets won their first Division III championship, defeating the Wittenberg Tigers by a final score of 24−10.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d02\", \"start\": 506, \"end\": 673, \"text\": \"The 1978 NCAA Division III Football Championship playoffs were the sixth annual single-elimination tournament to determine the national champion of men's NCAA Division\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 636, \"text\": \"1979 NCAA Division III football season - Wikipedia Jump to content Main menu Main menu move to sidebar hide Navigation Main page Contents Current events Random article About Wikipedia Contact us Contribute Help Learn to edit Community portal Recent changes Upload file Special pages Search Search Appearance Donate Create account Log in Personal tools Donate Create account Log in Pages for logged out editors learn more Contributions Talk Contents move to sidebar hide ( Top ) 1 Conference changes and new programs 2 Conference standings 3 Conference champions 4 Postseason Toggle Postseason subsection 4.1 Playoff bracket 5 See also 6\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"1978 college football season\", \"scope\": \"NCAA\", \"claim\": \"The 1978 college football season was part of Division I-A.\", \"answer\": \"Division I-A\", \"quote\": \"1978 NCAA Division I-A football season The 1978 NCAA Division I-A football season was the first season of Division I-A football; Division I-A was created in 1978 when Division I was subdivided into Division I-A and I-AA for football only.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"1978 college football season\", \"scope\": \"division\", \"claim\": \"The 1978 college football season was part of NCAA Division III.\", \"answer\": \"NCAA Division III\", \"quote\": \"Privacy policy About Wikidata Disclaimers Code of Conduct Developers Statistics Cookie statement Mobile view Data access Search Search 1978 NCAA Division III football season (Q4578219) Add topic\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"1978 college football season\", \"scope\": \"United States\", \"claim\": \"The 1978 college football season was part of the NCAA Division III.